      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"32\">STRESS-TESTING GREENGRID</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"95\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">A hypothetical battery-recycling startup</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"150\" width=\"560\" height=\"56\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#888\" fill-opacity=\"0.06\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"186\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\">1. Engineering</text><rect x=\"700\" y=\"150\" width=\"260\" height=\"56\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#10b981\" fill-opacity=\"0.16\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"830\" y=\"186\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\">STRONG</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"226\" width=\"560\" height=\"56\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#888\" fill-opacity=\"0.06\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\">2. Timing</text><rect x=\"700\" y=\"226\" width=\"260\" height=\"56\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#10b981\" fill-opacity=\"0.16\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"830\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\">STRONG</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"302\" width=\"560\" height=\"56\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#888\" fill-opacity=\"0.06\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"338\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\">4. People</text><rect x=\"700\" y=\"302\" width=\"260\" height=\"56\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#10b981\" fill-opacity=\"0.16\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"830\" y=\"338\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\">STRONG</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"378\" width=\"560\" height=\"56\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#888\" fill-opacity=\"0.06\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"414\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\">3. Monopoly</text><rect x=\"700\" y=\"378\" width=\"260\" height=\"56\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#ef4444\" fill-opacity=\"0.16\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"830\" y=\"414\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\">WEAK</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"454\" width=\"560\" height=\"56\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#888\" fill-opacity=\"0.06\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"490\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\">5. Distribution</text><rect x=\"700\" y=\"454\" width=\"260\" height=\"56\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#ef4444\" fill-opacity=\"0.16\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"830\" y=\"490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\">WEAK</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"530\" width=\"560\" height=\"56\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#888\" fill-opacity=\"0.06\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"566\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\">6. Durability</text><rect x=\"700\" y=\"530\" width=\"260\" height=\"56\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#ef4444\" fill-opacity=\"0.16\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"830\" y=\"566\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\">WEAK</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"606\" width=\"560\" height=\"56\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#888\" fill-opacity=\"0.06\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"642\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\">7. Secret</text><rect x=\"700\" y=\"606\" width=\"260\" height=\"56\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#ef4444\" fill-opacity=\"0.16\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"830\" y=\"642\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\">WEAK</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"690\" width=\"840\" height=\"100\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#ffd700\" fill-opacity=\"0.1\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"730\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\">Strong engineering, weak business</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"760\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\">strategy — the checklist finds the gap</text>\n</svg>",
      "caption": "Even strong engineering can hide a fragile business"
